    <briefdescription>
<para>GitHub Update Checker Subsystem. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides functionality to:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Periodically check GitHub for new releases</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Compare versions using semantic versioning</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Identify critical security patches</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Expose update status via HTTP API</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Support hot-reload for critical patches (future)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: All public methods are thread-safe </para>
